{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1478161-character-creation-for-tc-2e","id":1478161,"title":"Character Creation for TC 2E","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-06T12:09:26-07:00","id":1478161,"title":"Character Creation for TC 2E","content":"So I'm preparing to run <b>TC</b> multiera chronicle - one story in each TC era. However, I did not know mechanics of <b>TC</b>, for now. I have run <b>Scion</b> 2E and <b>They Came From </b>a few years now, but I suspect some difference from <b>TC</b> will come around. Best way for me to learn mechanics to new system is to create characters - so here is topic for Character Creations in <b>TC</b>. \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> I will start with my <b>Adventure!</b> example NPC - Thule member occultists I want to send against my players. Yes, I know most of Storypath antagonists are made by using templates - but I like make major story antagonists like PCs characters. It gives them depth and makes me learn mechanics sorta like players will in play.<br /> <br /> Let's start with...<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Ferdinand 'Franz' Herz - Adventure! era </b><b>Villain</b></span><br /> <b>Concept:</b> It's early 1923. Franz was lower class nobleman in times of German Empire ( till 1918 ), He was entrenched in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/V%C3%B6lkisch_movement\" target=\"_blank\">V\u00f6lkisch movement</a> occultism from his youth. Got rather good, but mainly lonely life with unloving parents and large 'duties to his homeland'. He still has resentment for crumbling of First Reich in Great War and more and more with Weimar Republic, as forced country made by WW 1 victors, on ashes of once Empire,<br /> <br /> He joined Thule Society in early 1918, to explore human capabilities and 'make Germany great again'. Quickly disillusioned with Republic and Thule itself - at start of 1920s, he traveled world to find the \u00dcbermensch possible source - he came to Far East. He is now fascinated by the rumors of people having Sight into the Future. And he is sensing in his dreams future problems with one word in his mind - <i><b>Aeon</b></i>...<br /> <br /> <b>Franz Aspirations:</b><br /> <b>Short</b> \u2013 Find \u2018Future Sight\u2019 relic ( to create \u00dcbermensch with it )<br /> <b>Short</b> \u2013 Show \u2018Aryan superiority\u2019 over others<br /> <b>Long</b> \u2013 Find the miracle for \u00dcbermensch ( now probably something like <u><b>Clairsentience</b></u> of ISRA from <b>TC Aeon</b> )<br /> <br /> Let's deep dive into rules then...<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Character Creation Summary</b></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Step One: Concept</span> </b><br /> Checked \u2705<br /> To Aspirations I will return later on...<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Step Two: Paths</span></b><br /> Checked \u2705<br /> Choose your character\u2019s Origin, Role, and Society Paths. Gain 3 Skill dots and 2 Edge dots from each Path.<br /> <br /> Franz has:<br /> Origin Path - <b><i>Occultist</i></b><br /> Role Path - <i><b>Mastermind</b></i><br /> Society Path - <i><b>Thule</b></i> ( See below )<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Franz Paths Edges</b></span><br /> <br /> Origin Path - <i><b>Occultist </b></i>- Iron Will (*), Polyglot (*)<br /> Role Path - <i><b>Mastermind </b></i>- Outsized Personality (*), Photographic Memory (*)<br /> <b>Society</b> - <b><i>Thule Society</i></b> - Useful Esoterica (*), Library (*)<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Step Three: Skills, Skill Tricks, and Specialties</span></b><br /> Checked \u2705<br /> Assign six additional Skill dots, and pick Specialties for any Skills with a high enough rating, and gain one Skill Trick in a Skill rated three or higher.<br /> <br /> <b>Franz has Skills:</b><br /> Aim 1, Athletics 1, Command 1, Culture 3, Enigmas 2, Empathy 3, Humanities 2, Integrity 2. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Step Four: Attributes</span></b><br /> Checked \u2705<br /> Assign your Attribute dots and select your character\u2019s favored approach.<br /> <br /> Intellect 3 Cunning 4 Resolve 3<br /> Might 1 Dexterity 3 Stamina 2<br /> Presence 2 Manipulation 4 Composure 2<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Step Five: Moment of Inspiration</b></span><br /> Checked \u2705<br /> Decide how the moment of Inspiration occurred, and whether the character became a daredevil, stalwart, or mesmerist.<br /> <br /> <b>Moment - Induced Inspiration</b> ( from <b>TC Adventure!</b> )<br /> Franz was experimenting with dangerous occult techniques to break the barrier that separate him from his true potential as \u2018Uber(Manch)Mesmerist\u2019! \ud83d\ude2e<br /> <b>Associated Attribute:</b> Resolve<br /> <br /> <b>Franz Attributes now\u2026</b><br /> Intellect 3 Cunning 4 Resolve 4<br /> Might 1 Dexterity 3 Stamina 2<br /> Presence 2 Manipulation 4 Composure 2<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Step Six: Add Advantages</span></b><br /> Facets, Gifts, etc.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Step Seven: Final Touches</span></b><br /> Calculate Health and Defense ratings, as detailed on p.38 of the Trinity Continuum Core.<br /> <br /> Assign one bonus dot to any Attribute, and spend four dots of Edges \u2014 these Edges can come from outside your character\u2019s Paths, but she must meet any other requirements normally.<br /> <br /> Facets and Inspiration","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-02-2022, 05:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-06T23:56:04-07:00","id":1478189,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Step Two: Paths</b></span><br /> Choose your character\u2019s Origin, Role, and Society Paths. Gain Skill dots and Edge dots from each Path.<br /> <br /> Okay, here I have a bit first problems\u2026<br /> <br /> <b>Origin Path</b> for Franz will clearly be <b><i>Occultist</i></b> ( V\u00f6lkisch movements )<br /> <br /> <b>Role Path</b> is first part I\u2019m a bit stuck. He do seems to me as part <b><i>Mastermind </i></b>character ( discovering \u2018miracles\u2019 and remaking Germany ) and a bit <b><i>Fixer</i></b> ( his late few years travels \u2013 at least from Great War times ). Or maybe <b><i>Adventurer</i></b> from TC core? ( But he does not seems to me as strict <b>Indiana Jones</b>-like character \u2013 rather those Nazis researches that shadow Indiana in his movies\u2026 ) A bit more <b>Mastermind</b> than <b>Fixer</b>, but maybe a mix of those two Paths? What do you forumers think about it?<br /> <br /> <b>Society Path</b> would normally be Allegiance. He is not part of any official Allegiances. For him, <b>Thule Society</b> is this Path. But now I need to make it for <b>TC</b>. Let\u2019s see\u2026<br /> <br /> <b>Thule Society</b><br /> (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thule_Society\" target=\"_blank\">Based on this Wikipedia article</a>)<br /> Thule Society is like dark mirror of Aeon Society. Made just after Great War by German nationalists and occultists, it was foundation for Nazis party. Full of academics, adventurers, researchers \u2013 and politicians - it became first organization for collecting weird knowledge for Second and then Third Reich. Support from nobles and capitalists alike give Thule great funds for exotic travels and weird researches or experiments. It was devoured by it\u2019s children, when in 1935 Nazi part delegalized it. Ex Thule members become prominent people in party and <b>Ahnenerbe</b> section of the SS, dwelling it to occult and strange for Vaterland.<br /> <br /> <b>Example Connections: </b>German Nationalists ( especially Nazis ), Theosophical societies, Academics<br /> <b>Skills: </b>Culture, Enigmas, Humanities, Science<br /> <b>Edges: </b><b>Edges: </b>Adrenaline Spike, Battle Buddy, Dig Deep, Library, Patron, Safe House, Useful Esoterica<br /> <b>Daredevil Gift Keywords: </b>??? ( Need to look in to Daredevil splats info )<br /> <br /> So what do you think about all it? As always, I ask mechanical mentor <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24985_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24985\" data-vbnamecard=\"24985\">Mateus Luz</a> especially for help. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-21-2022, 01:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-08T02:18:34-07:00","id":1478266,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the title... maybe I can get some scale in my future actions using it... haha<br /> <br /> While TC has a more &quot;solid set&quot; of Paths, it doesnt mean you are locked on them, so, if you are creating a character that is halfway between role paths, there is nothing that forbides you from creating your own paths, so you can build a path that is a mix of Mastermind and a Fixer. In your case specifically, I would go for his more active aspect, that is Mastermind, and maybe use the Fixer idea as part of the Occultist origin (you must do a lot of things to survive as an Occultist).<br /> <br /> Now, for your society, I like the Aeon's Evil Twin idea, mirroring the entire society path. Daredevils gifts keywords are skills, attributes and luck, and Luck is not an option for path keywords, so pick 3 skills (from the 4 above) and you are done, my suggestion, Culture, Enigmas and Humanities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-10T05:17:12-07:00","id":1478481,"title":"","content":"Is Franz a good guy (maybe he leaves the Thule Society for a more heroic Path) or a bad guy?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-10T05:25:40-07:00","id":1478483,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1478161-character-creation-for-tc-2e?p=1478481#post1478481\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is Franz a good guy (maybe he leaves the Thule Society for a more heroic Path) or a bad guy?</div> </div> </div> </div>He is prepared as main story Villian for PCs, i.e. Antagonists. He may leave Thule recently - but clearly for some nefarious goal, in the end.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-10-2022, 08:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-13T21:35:57-07:00","id":1478820,"title":"","content":"So now we got questions...<br /> 1. I'm thinking about making Franz a Mesmerist - He can be member and using it, even if Thule Society Path is for Daredevils?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-14T03:42:20-07:00","id":1478838,"title":"","content":"Why not? A Mesmerist in the Thule society would prove their racial supremacist agenda\u2026<br /> <br /> The only thing is, Franz would not have access to the Daredevil Gifts, as he is not a Deredevil\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-15T21:17:25-07:00","id":1478933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1478161-character-creation-for-tc-2e#post1478161\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Step Three: Skills, Skill Tricks, and Specialties </span></b><br /> Assign six additional Skill dots, and pick Specialties for any Skills with a high enough rating,<br /> and gain one Skill Trick in a Skill rated three or higher.</div> </div> </div> </div><b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Let's look what Skills packages Franz Paths gives us...</span></b><br /> Origin - <b>Occultist </b>- Skills: Enigmas, Humanities, Integrity, Science<br /> Role - <b>Mastermind</b> - Skills: Command, Empathy, Enigmas, Technology<br /> Society -<b> Thule </b>- Skills: Culture, Enigmas, Humanities, Science<br /> <br /> So choosing 3 Skills dots by each Path...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Origin - <b>Occultist </b>- Skills: Enigmas, Humanities, Integrity, Science</div> </div> </div> </div>From <b>Occultist</b>, I will take Enigmas 1, Humanities 1, Integrity 1<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Role - <b>Mastermind</b> - Skills: Command, Empathy, Enigmas, Technology</div> </div> </div> </div>From <b>Mastermind</b>, I will take Command 1, Empathy 1, Enigmas 1<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Society -<b> Thule </b>- Skills: Culture, Enigmas, Humanities, Science</div> </div> </div> </div>From <b>Thule</b>, I will take Culture 2, Humanities 1<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">After Paths packages, Franz have those Skills:</span></b><br /> Command 1, Culture 2, Enigmas 2, Empathy 1, Humanities 2, Integrity 1.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Now we go for 6 'free' Skill dots, outside the Paths...</span></b><br /> Franz would like took dots in:<br /> Culture 1 - He traveled quite a bit and is versed in weird ancient cultures<br /> Empathy 2 - As Mesmerist, I suspect it's important Skill for him<br /> Integrity 1 - He need to be self-reliant<br /> In those dangerous times, guy need to protect himself, so -<br /> Aim 1 and Atheltics 1<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In the end, Franz has those Skills</span></b><br /> Aim 1, Athletics 1, Command 1, Culture 3, Enigmas 2, Empathy 3, Humanities 2, Integrity 2. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-16-2022, 11:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-15T21:44:03-07:00","id":1478934,"title":"","content":"2. <b>Do I get it right that <i>Enigmas</i> Skill can work for semi-<i>Occult</i> Skill in Trinity? </b>The knowledge of myths and legends would be in the <i>Humanites</i> Skill - but 'I understand that three turning in the left and pulling this light source summons this being' - would be much more<i> Enigmas</i> Skill?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-16T03:53:17-07:00","id":1478940,"title":"","content":"Maybe you got it, but didn\u2019t use, but you have 3 dots to spend on each path, not 3 skills with 1 dot in each, for example, you could go for Occultist giving Humanity 3. You spend it evenly, what is not bad, I just want to make it clear you have more options.<br /> <br /> Enigmas is more about mathematics, codes and logic, while myths and legends would be more related to culture (as I see). Humanities, at least for me, is more about human behavior, psychology, things like that, while Culture is more focused on the general knowledge related to beliefs, legends, traditions and popular knowledge.<br /> <br /> In other words, you probably would need to focus on Culture to get a general knowledge about occultism, but you may find some occultist aspects in other skills, like a lot of Egyptian and Greek traditions are related to the principles of mathematics (geometry, mainly), so a character with high Enigmas may know a lot about ancient Greeks and Egyptians tricks. It may happen with any skill actually, Enigmas related to the story of numbers, numerology, secret codes, etc, Science may have some information related to astrology and seasonal traditions, Humanities may have informations about how people behave in certain places due to their traditions, etc.<br /> <br /> The small number of skills in Storypath is a very interesting thing that gives a lot of space to play. I really love it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-16T08:13:41-07:00","id":1478954,"title":"","content":"I slightly changed 1 dot of Enigmas for 1 dot to Culture - so Franz be real occultist/folklorist. Thanks <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24985_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24985\" data-vbnamecard=\"24985\">Mateus Luz</a> for point on '<b>Occult</b> as <b>Culture </b>vs <b>Humanities</b> vs <b>Enigmas</b>' description. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-16-2022, 11:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-16T11:29:38-07:00","id":1478967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1478161-character-creation-for-tc-2e?p=1478934#post1478934\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. <b>Do I get it right that <i>Enigmas</i> Skill can work for semi-<i>Occult</i> Skill in Trinity? </b>The knowledge of myths and legends would be in the <i>Humanites</i> Skill - but 'I understand that three turning in the left and pulling this light source summons this being' - would be much more<i> Enigmas</i> Skill?</div> </div> </div> </div>In addition to math and codes, Enigmas is good for solving riddles and puzzles, so it could be useful for some sorts of occult rolls, since many mystic texts are likely written in purposefully obscure ways to keep the knowledge out of the hands of the uninitiated. On the other hand, if you're dealing with a famous riddle (such as the riddle of the sphinx), you could roll Humanities, Culture, or Enigmas, since they'd all apply. As a rule of thumb, I'd say that any roll to remember a fact you've read would benefit from Humanities or Culture, while a roll to figure out something new would use Enigmas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T10:21:42-07:00","id":1487401,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><i>Thule Society</i> Path, version 2.0 </b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Example Connections: </b>German Nationalists ( especially Nazis ), Theosophical societies, Academics<br /> <b>Skills: </b>Culture, Enigmas, Humanities, Science<br /> <b>Edges: </b><b>Edges: </b>Adrenaline Spike, Battle Buddy, Dig Deep, Library, Patron, Safe House, Useful Esoterica<br /> <b>Daredevil Gift Keywords: </b>??? ( Need to look in to Daredevil splats info )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T10:32:04-07:00","id":1487403,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Franz Paths Edges</b></span><br /> <br /> Origin Path - <i><b>Occultist </b></i>- Iron Will (*), Polyglot (*)<br /> Role Path - <i><b>Mastermind </b></i>- Outsized Personality (*), Photographic Memory (*)<br /> <b>Society</b> - <b><i>Thule Society</i></b> - Useful Esoterica (*), Library (*)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-29T12:29:38-07:00","id":1488381,"title":"","content":"Subtopic - <b>How do you decide what character can have from Equipment?</b> There aren't rules for it in Character Creation chapter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-29T12:43:41-07:00","id":1488387,"title":"","content":"You can have all equipment that makes sense from your paths and wealth.<br /> <br /> Paths are used for most day to day equipments, like cars, guns, computers, cloths, disguises, etc, if you character is military probably have a fun, if is a suburb white collar probably have a car a nice house and things like that.<br /> <br /> Wealth is for things you should not have, but do.<br /> <br /> Additionally all inspired have access to supertech items, a total of ranks equal to Inspiration + 2 x wealth (replace Inspiration by quantum or psi), in addition to the ones bought with Artifact edge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-29T14:10:56-07:00","id":1488392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1478161-character-creation-for-tc-2e?p=1488381#post1488381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Subtopic - <b>How do you decide what character can have from Equipment?</b> There aren't rules for it in Character Creation chapter.</div> </div> </div> </div>The assumption we make in our games is that your alliance, apart from paying you a decent living wage, covers all expenses related to the mission and provides you with all the equipment/resources you may need, within reason of course. If you want something more specialized or powerful, you have to convince your contacts in the alliance and explain why you need it or purchase the artifact edge. If you want to have more freedom when it comes to equipment, you can also purchase the wealth edge, plus it can also give you bonuses in social situations","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2964,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","user":"Firanai","date":". 07-30-2022, 05:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-11T06:48:11-07:00","id":1492801,"title":"","content":"Returning to Franz idea, as need him in my story...<br /> <br /> <b>Franz Aspirations propositions:</b><br /> <b>Short</b> \u2013 Find \u2018Future Sight\u2019 relic ( to create \u00dcbermensch with it )<br /> <b>Short</b> \u2013 Show \u2018Aryan superiority\u2019 over others<br /> <b>Long</b> \u2013 Find the miracle for \u00dcbermensch ( now probably something like <u><b>Clairsentience</b></u> of ISRA from <b>TC Aeon</b> )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-01T23:47:00-07:00","id":1494123,"title":"","content":"Returning to end Franz creation for game... \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Step Four: Attributes</span></b><br /> Checked \u2705<br /> Assign your Attribute dots and select your character\u2019s favored approach.<br /> <br /> Intellect 3 Cunning 4 Resolve 3<br /> Might 1 Dexterity 3 Stamina 2<br /> Presence 2 Manipulation 4 Composure 2<br /> <br /> <b>Step Five: Moment of Inspiration</b><br /> Checked \u2705<br /> Decide how the moment of Inspiration occurred, and whether the character became a daredevil, stalwart, or mesmerist.<br /> <br /> <b>Moment - Induced Inspiration</b> ( from <b>TC Adventure!</b> )<br /> Franz was experimenting with dangerous occult techniques to break the barrier that separate him from his true potential as \u2018Uber(Manch)Mesmerist\u2019! \ud83d\ude2e<br /> <b>Associated Attribute:</b> Resolve<br /> <br /> <b>Franz Attributes now\u2026</b><br /> Intellect 3 Cunning 4 Resolve 4<br /> Might 1 Dexterity 3 Stamina 2<br /> Presence 2 Manipulation 4 Composure 2<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-02-2022, 05:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}